First thing to check is if the Exabyte is a Differential SCSI model.  If
so, you need a converter.  You might also do a sho dev in console mode,
to see if the hardware can communicate at all with the tape.  Maybe it can
communicate, but it doesn't correctly recognize the tape as either a tape
or disk device, in which case VMS won't connect a device driver to it.


