Another method of breaking into a crippled system from sysboot which can be
used even if sypagswpfiles has a loop (min boot runs sypagswpfiles) is:
sysboot> set/startup opa0:
sysboot> continue
$spawn
$ install add sys$share:secureshr.exe/open/header/share/prot

At this point you will have a significant subset of VMS available so you can
fix the problem and reboot

