A DEC OSF/1 engineer has kindly responded:

This error is caused by a failure to set the console variable
bus_probe_algorithm to "new".  This is covered in the Release notes
for both V3.0B and T3.2.  This variable is new with V3.8 of the
console firmware (which in also listed in the RL notes as required
for the new OSF version).

On systems such as the DEC2100, this variable must be set to old for
versions prior to V3.0B, and it must be set to new for versions V3.0B
and later.

One last item.  After setting the variable, you must power off/on the
machine, or type init at the console.



